WEBVTT

00:00:12.624 --> 00:00:16.554
As I'm sure you all know, as we
entered the 21st Century,

00:00:16.624 --> 00:00:21.224
the number of espers, people with
psychic powers, suddenly increased.

00:00:21.224 --> 00:00:25.364
However, there are many power levels
for what we generally term "ESP".

00:00:25.364 --> 00:00:27.904
The weakest level can really only
sense other ESP-sensitive people.

00:00:27.904 --> 00:00:31.234
Lvl. 1 - Can sense people standing
still, especially the ESP-sensitive.
Lvl. 2 - Can sense most people,
can shake doors and shoji screens.
The weakest level can really only
sense other ESP-sensitive people.

00:00:31.234 --> 00:00:33.144
Lvl. 1 - Can sense people standing
still, especially the ESP-sensitive.
Lvl. 2 - Can sense most people,
can shake doors and shoji screens.
Level 2's can sense most people,
while Level 3's can shake buildings.

00:00:33.144 --> 00:00:36.574
Level 2's can sense most people,
while Level 3's can shake buildings.

00:00:36.574 --> 00:00:38.744
Level 4's can knock over flower vases,

00:00:38.744 --> 00:00:41.684
while Level 5's can fracture walls.

00:00:41.684 --> 00:00:45.014
Level 6's can put fissures in the
ground and cause landslides.

00:00:45.084 --> 00:00:49.784
The highest level, Level 7's, can destroy
any object and throw them into the air.

00:00:50.124 --> 00:00:53.264
However, the higher the power level,
the rarer they become.

00:00:53.264 --> 00:00:56.464
There are only three Level 7's
in the entire country.

00:00:56.464 --> 00:00:59.834
Powerful espers really are
a valuable commodity!

00:01:00.304 --> 00:01:03.204
They say that the number
of espers is increasing,

00:01:03.204 --> 00:01:06.074
but ESP is only one of many fine talents.

00:01:06.074 --> 00:01:07.874
I'm sure we'll all be able to get along with them.

00:01:07.874 --> 00:01:09.844
Well, I don't want to!

00:01:09.844 --> 00:01:10.714
Takashi!

00:01:10.714 --> 00:01:14.884
Espers can read your mind and
move things from far away!

00:01:14.884 --> 00:01:18.784
That's really scary! I can't play
with anyone like that!

00:01:23.594 --> 00:01:25.624
Abort! Abort simulation!

00:01:25.624 --> 00:01:28.154
We've had an accident!
Get those fires out, at once!

00:01:32.704 --> 00:01:34.934
Well, excuse me for being an esper!

00:01:37.434 --> 00:01:39.634
It's... It's all over...

00:01:44.674 --> 00:01:49.774
Esper: People who possess psychic powers.

00:01:50.184 --> 00:01:52.774
PSYCHIC CUTTING STROKE!

00:01:57.654 --> 00:01:59.684
In short, this girl is an esper.

00:02:02.564 --> 00:02:04.364
Up, down, up, left, down, right, left.

00:02:04.364 --> 00:02:05.864
Right, right, down, up, up, left.

00:02:05.864 --> 00:02:07.704
Right, right, down, right, up, left, up.

00:02:07.704 --> 00:02:09.374
Down, down, left, up, right, down, left.

00:02:09.374 --> 00:02:11.234
Right, left, up, down, down, right, down.

00:02:11.974 --> 00:02:14.534
And the tape's coming off in
the upper-left hand corner.

00:02:14.644 --> 00:02:15.764
PSYCHOMETRY TEST CHART

00:02:17.344 --> 00:02:19.244
This girl, too, is an esper.

00:02:26.184 --> 00:02:27.744
Esper girl with glasses.

00:02:28.754 --> 00:02:32.714
As we've entered the 21st Century,
the number of espers has risen.

00:02:33.524 --> 00:02:36.564
The question of how to effectively
make use of the psychic powers

00:02:36.564 --> 00:02:39.134
they possess has become a
matter of worldwide concern.

00:02:39.134 --> 00:02:41.734
In Japan, psychic research is centered around

00:02:41.734 --> 00:02:45.134
the government's special
esper support laboratory:

00:02:45.134 --> 00:02:47.504
More commonly known as BABEL.

00:02:49.614 --> 00:02:55.444
This story is a lovely portrait of the
activities and growth of "The Children,"

00:02:55.444 --> 00:02:58.384
the special esper team assigned to BABEL.

00:03:02.494 --> 00:03:03.884
Supposedly.

00:03:04.324 --> 00:03:07.224
It's pretty awesome, invincible power!

00:03:07.624 --> 00:03:10.494
Boy, does it feel great

00:03:10.864 --> 00:03:13.624
Absolutely lovely! So we never lose!

00:03:14.064 --> 00:03:17.234
Come on, let's head for tomorrow!

00:03:19.174 --> 00:03:20.304
Zettai Karen Children

00:03:20.304 --> 00:03:21.444
Zettai Karen Children
Yeah!

00:03:21.444 --> 00:03:22.744
Zettai Karen Children
Absolutely!

00:03:22.744 --> 00:03:24.414
Zettai Karen Children

00:03:24.414 --> 00:03:25.434
Zettai Karen Children
Daring!

00:03:25.614 --> 00:03:28.884
It just takes a touch for me to know

00:03:28.884 --> 00:03:31.354
The limiter on my heart

00:03:32.084 --> 00:03:34.784
Has been released, and then you see

00:03:35.184 --> 00:03:38.384
Yes! Change the world!

00:03:38.624 --> 00:03:41.494
Trying again and again through hot battle!

00:03:41.794 --> 00:03:45.094
Reaching through what's real

00:03:45.094 --> 00:03:48.334
Absolutely lovely! So we never lose!

00:03:48.334 --> 00:03:51.274
The thrills just can't be beat!

00:03:52.404 --> 00:03:58.874
Courage begins to light the
darkness of the world

00:03:58.874 --> 00:04:04.814
It overflows with the miracles you gave

00:04:05.254 --> 00:04:09.654
If you can take pride in a smile

00:04:09.654 --> 00:04:11.644
That suits no one else

00:04:11.854 --> 00:04:16.394
Then let's go beyond the future now

00:04:16.394 --> 00:04:20.494
We can try over the future world!

00:04:20.734 --> 00:04:21.094
Yeah!

00:04:21.834 --> 00:04:22.494
Ultimate!

00:04:24.634 --> 00:04:25.864
Daring!

00:04:37.214 --> 00:04:38.914
5th sense.
"Carelessness is the Greatest Enemy!
No Normals Allowed, Okay?"

00:04:40.224 --> 00:04:43.384
This story starts a week ago...

00:04:43.554 --> 00:04:46.724
Hey! I've got breakfast ready.

00:04:47.694 --> 00:04:50.524
Hey! Would you get up, already?

00:04:51.134 --> 00:04:53.364
It's morning! Hm?

00:05:01.974 --> 00:05:04.874
They're at it, day after day.

00:05:04.874 --> 00:05:07.384
It must get boring.

00:05:07.384 --> 00:05:11.514
It's because going to school
is like work for normal kids.

00:05:11.514 --> 00:05:13.854
Well, I'd hate that sort of work!

00:05:13.854 --> 00:05:17.654
I can't believe Naomi goes to school every day.

00:05:34.404 --> 00:05:35.644
School?

00:05:35.644 --> 00:05:39.984
Yes! Those girls would normally be
going to elementary school, right?

00:05:39.984 --> 00:05:43.284
They need to go to school, like normal children!

00:05:43.284 --> 00:05:44.754
Look...

00:05:47.124 --> 00:05:50.884
The girls receive age-appropriate
instruction here at BABEL.

00:05:52.194 --> 00:05:54.554
I don't think there's any problem.

00:05:54.694 --> 00:05:57.334
That's just giving them book learning!

00:05:57.334 --> 00:05:59.494
It doesn't teach them how to socialize
or cooperate with others.

00:05:59.804 --> 00:06:04.134
The girls may deny it, but they
want to go to school.

00:06:04.134 --> 00:06:05.504
I can tell by how they act.

00:06:05.734 --> 00:06:07.944
Please, let them go to elementary school.

00:06:07.944 --> 00:06:10.404
It's in their best interests!

00:06:10.674 --> 00:06:13.204
Those girls came here to BABEL 5 years ago.

00:06:30.064 --> 00:06:32.534
The exact details may have varied,

00:06:32.534 --> 00:06:34.804
but all three came for the same basic reason.

00:06:34.804 --> 00:06:38.064
It was because society at
large had rejected them.

00:06:38.934 --> 00:06:40.544
It's difficult for a five-year-old...

00:06:40.544 --> 00:06:43.004
to understand the difference
between right and wrong.

00:06:43.244 --> 00:06:47.004
If they allowed their powers to explode
from pure emotion, it'd be trouble.

00:06:47.644 --> 00:06:49.614
No kindergarten would accept them.

00:06:49.614 --> 00:06:52.984
BABEL was the only place they had left to go.

00:06:53.254 --> 00:06:55.424
I... I understand that.

00:06:55.424 --> 00:06:57.254
But unlike 5 years ago,

00:06:57.254 --> 00:07:01.064
they understand right and wrong just fine now.

00:07:01.064 --> 00:07:03.564
They wouldn't use their powers unthinkingly.

00:07:03.564 --> 00:07:05.994
The problem is the Ministry of Education!

00:07:06.634 --> 00:07:09.034
With the development of portable limiters,

00:07:09.034 --> 00:07:12.634
we're now able to suppress psychic
powers to a certain point.

00:07:12.874 --> 00:07:16.864
But, while weak espers are
allowed to go to school,

00:07:17.444 --> 00:07:19.464
that only applies to Level 3's and below!

00:07:20.784 --> 00:07:25.584
The Ministry still opposes allowing
Level 4's and above to attend schools.

00:07:25.584 --> 00:07:28.724
Some nonsense about protecting
other students from bad effects.

00:07:28.724 --> 00:07:32.814
But Naomi Umegae attends high school,
and she's a Level 6!

00:07:35.124 --> 00:07:38.994
Because BABEL donates a lot
of money to that school.

00:07:39.194 --> 00:07:41.334
I suppose, but...

00:07:41.334 --> 00:07:43.704
There's all sorts of problems aside from that.

00:07:43.704 --> 00:07:45.774
More than anything else,

00:07:45.774 --> 00:07:49.004
the deciding factor will be how
well the girls will behave.

00:07:51.144 --> 00:07:53.114
Minamoto, huh? Quit it!

00:07:53.114 --> 00:07:55.244
Let me take a peek inside your mind!

00:07:55.544 --> 00:07:57.714
I'll take us someplace I like!

00:08:03.294 --> 00:08:05.754
Not a good prospect...

00:08:08.794 --> 00:08:10.994
I just realized, this is the first time...

00:08:10.994 --> 00:08:13.964
I've come home early since
starting work with BABEL.

00:08:14.904 --> 00:08:17.234
Maybe I'll surprise the girls a little.

00:08:20.344 --> 00:08:22.074
Oh, whatcha watching?

00:08:22.074 --> 00:08:24.104
A 101-legged race.

00:08:24.614 --> 00:08:28.244
A hundred friends got together,
and instead of a three-legged race,

00:08:28.244 --> 00:08:30.874
they said they're doing a 101-legged
race. Just some stupid show.

00:08:32.514 --> 00:08:34.354
Ready...

00:08:36.554 --> 00:08:38.354
Stupid!

00:09:21.734 --> 00:09:23.894
Minamoto, this is brilliant!

00:09:27.704 --> 00:09:30.764
Starting next week, you thee are
going to elementary school!

00:09:32.144 --> 00:09:34.484
E-E-Elementary school?!

00:09:34.484 --> 00:09:38.414
As in, place where kids study and do
sports? THAT elementary school?!

00:09:38.414 --> 00:09:40.474
Is there another type of elementary school?

00:09:40.724 --> 00:09:42.354
Yoshiko put you up to this, right?

00:09:42.354 --> 00:09:42.824
I know! It was Sally!
Yoshiko put you up to this, right?

00:09:42.824 --> 00:09:43.894
I know! It was Sally!
We're not allowed to go to school!

00:09:43.894 --> 00:09:45.444
We're not allowed to go to school!

00:09:45.624 --> 00:09:47.994
It's not a joke. I'm totally serious.

00:09:47.994 --> 00:09:50.154
Besides, it's an order.

00:09:50.334 --> 00:09:51.264
Order?

00:09:51.264 --> 00:09:55.034
This century's seeing a sudden
rise in the number of espers!

00:09:55.034 --> 00:09:57.334
Especially among the younger age groups!

00:09:57.834 --> 00:10:00.644
In short, it's possible we'll be seeing

00:10:00.644 --> 00:10:04.004
ESP-related incidents even
in elementary schools!

00:10:05.314 --> 00:10:06.414
I get you!

00:10:06.414 --> 00:10:08.514
And so, you special espers

00:10:08.514 --> 00:10:11.654
may have to be infiltrated
into elementary schools

00:10:11.654 --> 00:10:14.084
in order to deal with these situations!

00:10:14.084 --> 00:10:16.124
Yeah! Yeah, you're right!

00:10:16.124 --> 00:10:20.294
And for those situations, you'll need
to know what a school is like!

00:10:20.294 --> 00:10:22.264
That's why you're going to school!

00:10:22.264 --> 00:10:24.064
I see.

00:10:24.064 --> 00:10:26.294
Minamoto really thought this through.

00:10:27.834 --> 00:10:32.434
The Ministry can't object if it's for
a "necessary mission," can they?

00:10:32.674 --> 00:10:35.944
However, I didn't give Minamoto's
plan the go sign

00:10:35.944 --> 00:10:38.504
just for the sake of those three.

00:10:39.314 --> 00:10:40.614
"SPECIAL ESPER TEAM 'THE CHILDREN'
SCHOOL ATTENDANCE PROJECT"

00:10:40.614 --> 00:10:42.144
"SPECIAL ESPER TEAM 'THE CHILDREN'
SCHOOL ATTENDANCE PROJECT"
Is this?

00:10:42.244 --> 00:10:44.484
The Children School Attendance Project.

00:10:44.484 --> 00:10:47.574
A national project with a 3 billion yen budget.

00:10:48.784 --> 00:10:51.124
If we can prove that the most powerful...

00:10:51.124 --> 00:10:53.664
Level 7 espers can attend school normally,

00:10:53.664 --> 00:10:56.254
then all espers will be able to attend schools.

00:10:56.934 --> 00:10:59.494
He thought this through that far.

00:11:00.504 --> 00:11:02.834
Well, orders are orders!

00:11:07.974 --> 00:11:10.814
Now, be sure to write your
names on your things.

00:11:10.814 --> 00:11:12.374
I-I know!

00:11:12.374 --> 00:11:15.614
School, huh? Kind of a pain.

00:11:15.614 --> 00:11:18.174
Maybe it'll help pass the time.

00:11:18.654 --> 00:11:21.674
Well, duty calls and we can't say no.

00:11:22.224 --> 00:11:24.554
KAORU AKASHI

00:11:29.124 --> 00:11:32.154
Which brings us to this.

00:11:33.134 --> 00:11:36.794
Kaoru! How many times do I have to tell
you, don't blow up your classmates!

00:11:37.004 --> 00:11:38.604
But he pissed me off!

00:11:38.604 --> 00:11:40.644
So being pissed off means you
can do whatever you want?!

00:11:40.644 --> 00:11:42.974
What are you, a wild tiger?!

00:11:42.974 --> 00:11:45.644
Who cares? I didn't actually kill anyone.

00:11:45.644 --> 00:11:47.644
But what if you had?!

00:11:47.644 --> 00:11:51.754
Lay off! She's just getting as
mad as we'd like to be!

00:11:51.754 --> 00:11:55.754
Exactly! If Kaoru had let a crack like that pass,

00:11:55.754 --> 00:11:58.484
I would have scanned him till his brains melted!

00:11:58.954 --> 00:12:01.054
Well, um...

00:12:11.004 --> 00:12:14.544
Minamoto! Well, everything going well?

00:12:14.544 --> 00:12:17.214
Chief! Um, er, that is...

00:12:17.214 --> 00:12:19.714
Never mind, we've got trouble!

00:12:19.714 --> 00:12:22.144
The precogs have predicted a terrorist
attack on headquarters!

00:12:22.144 --> 00:12:25.254
What? You mean here, at BABEL HQ?

00:12:25.254 --> 00:12:27.844
Right! We have to be on high alert!

00:12:28.724 --> 00:12:32.394
What are you doing?
We're in the middle of class.

00:12:32.394 --> 00:12:35.024
Huh? But we're on rest break.

00:12:35.024 --> 00:12:37.894
What, is this part of the simulation, too?

00:12:39.064 --> 00:12:40.764
This is why...

00:12:42.734 --> 00:12:44.634
Something's wrong!

00:12:45.534 --> 00:12:48.994
Why espers should be wiped
off the face of the Earth!

00:12:54.184 --> 00:12:55.844
So, this is goodbye.

00:12:58.654 --> 00:13:00.844
Darling Moga-chan, I love you so!

00:13:01.424 --> 00:13:04.824
Espers should be wiped off the face of the Earth!

00:13:07.824 --> 00:13:09.294
What's the big idea?!

00:13:20.244 --> 00:13:21.764
Huh? What's going on?

00:13:25.644 --> 00:13:27.714
What's?!

00:13:27.714 --> 00:13:29.984
Yo! So, how've you been?

00:13:29.984 --> 00:13:31.814
Welcome back, Sakaki.

00:13:31.814 --> 00:13:33.624
Nice work on your business trip.

00:13:33.624 --> 00:13:38.084
So, how about thanking for my
hard work with a date tonight?

00:13:42.994 --> 00:13:45.494
Naomi! I know this is hard,

00:13:45.494 --> 00:13:48.434
but you'll eventually realize the
charm of reaching a happy medium!

00:13:48.434 --> 00:13:49.764
Not in my whole life!

00:13:53.004 --> 00:13:55.604
I was nearly finished, too!

00:13:59.644 --> 00:14:02.084
"NORMAL NORMAL NORMAL NORMAL
NORMAL NORMAL NORMAL NORMAL"

00:14:02.684 --> 00:14:04.654
Attention, people of BABEL!

00:14:04.654 --> 00:14:08.514
We are the Normal People, a group
dedicated to wiping out espers!

00:14:08.784 --> 00:14:10.224
The Normal People!

00:14:10.224 --> 00:14:11.814
What's that?

00:14:12.324 --> 00:14:14.864
We've had, like, a million lectures about them.

00:14:14.864 --> 00:14:17.234
The Normal People is the name of their group.

00:14:17.234 --> 00:14:21.634
They commit all sorts of crimes and
harassments against espers.

00:14:21.634 --> 00:14:24.534
Basically, they're an anti-esper terrorist group.

00:14:24.534 --> 00:14:25.334
Anti-esper?

00:14:25.874 --> 00:14:28.204
Our nation has no need for espers!

00:14:29.874 --> 00:14:30.904
"EMERGENCY CONTAINMENT BULKHEADS"

00:14:31.314 --> 00:14:33.214
What? It's doing it by itself!

00:14:33.684 --> 00:14:37.414
They attack businesses and
organizations that use espers.

00:14:37.414 --> 00:14:38.754
Naturally, BABEL, as well.

00:14:38.754 --> 00:14:42.584
We have already taken control
of BABEL's computer system!

00:14:44.494 --> 00:14:45.554
The shutters!

00:14:45.554 --> 00:14:47.524
The emergency bulkheads are closing, too!

00:14:47.994 --> 00:14:49.824
No good. The phones are dead.

00:14:54.634 --> 00:14:56.654
Moga-chan's outfit!

00:14:57.134 --> 00:14:59.624
Our nation has no need for espers!

00:14:59.974 --> 00:15:02.244
Not just terrorism, but cyber terrorism!

00:15:02.244 --> 00:15:04.414
With them and using their power

00:15:04.414 --> 00:15:07.284
will mean the destruction
of human civilization!

00:15:07.284 --> 00:15:10.044
Death to the espers!

00:15:10.284 --> 00:15:13.544
And we'll start by wiping
out the espers of BABEL!

00:15:14.284 --> 00:15:15.584
Bring it on!

00:15:15.924 --> 00:15:19.654
C'mon, jerks, I'll blow you all away!
Wait! Do you know how much
those things cost?!

00:15:19.654 --> 00:15:21.024
SILENCE!

00:15:21.364 --> 00:15:23.794
Bigoted scum!

00:15:24.934 --> 00:15:28.764
How dare you say that about my
espers, my national treasures!

00:15:29.164 --> 00:15:30.874
Ch-Chief...

00:15:30.874 --> 00:15:33.444
Wow! He's doing damage like a Level 6!

00:15:33.444 --> 00:15:36.404
You don't need psychic powers
with brute strength like that.

00:15:36.404 --> 00:15:38.034
That's BABEL's chief for you.

00:15:38.614 --> 00:15:40.484
Nobody hold back!

00:15:40.484 --> 00:15:42.814
I'll get the budget to pay for it,
no matter what it costs!

00:15:43.044 --> 00:15:44.614
Okay...

00:15:44.614 --> 00:15:47.384
PSYCHIC MASS CLASS DISMISSAL!

00:15:49.184 --> 00:15:52.554
And here's a another way you
can use teleportation!

00:15:58.494 --> 00:16:01.124
Damn! They're going after the other espers!

00:16:03.474 --> 00:16:06.304
Minamoto! Sound the alert
over the emergency intercom!

00:16:06.744 --> 00:16:08.174
Gotcha!

00:16:09.474 --> 00:16:12.574
Attention, BABEL personnel!
Attention, BABEL personnel!

00:16:12.574 --> 00:16:13.584
That's...
We're under cyberattack by the Normal People!

00:16:13.584 --> 00:16:15.814
Minamoto's voice!
We're under cyberattack by the Normal People!

00:16:16.214 --> 00:16:18.814
Runaway robots are spreading
through the complex!

00:16:18.884 --> 00:16:19.954
Them!

00:16:19.954 --> 00:16:22.714
A little young to be delinquents, aren't you?!

00:16:25.694 --> 00:16:29.564
How dare you ruin Moga-chan's
outfit! KILL THEM!

00:16:37.434 --> 00:16:39.404
Okay, stick together, no matter what!

00:16:39.404 --> 00:16:43.244
If they split your precog powers up, we'll all die!

00:16:43.244 --> 00:16:44.404
There, in 5 seconds!

00:16:45.114 --> 00:16:47.574
3... 2... 1...

00:16:52.054 --> 00:16:54.144
Naomi, attack! Get them!

00:16:54.524 --> 00:16:57.894
What?! But... I can't attack little kids!

00:16:57.894 --> 00:17:00.684
They're kids on the outside,
but robots on the inside!

00:17:02.394 --> 00:17:05.024
Don't touch me, you middle-aged creep!

00:17:05.294 --> 00:17:06.894
Well done, Naomi!

00:17:07.304 --> 00:17:08.894
You, too!

00:17:09.664 --> 00:17:11.394
Chief, I have the vaccine software!

00:17:11.604 --> 00:17:14.044
Ah, it's ready! Install it at once!

00:17:14.044 --> 00:17:14.974
Right!

00:17:14.974 --> 00:17:17.044
Vaccine, Chief?

00:17:17.044 --> 00:17:19.564
We knew there was a threat of cyber terrorism.

00:17:19.944 --> 00:17:22.574
I had them rush development on it.

00:17:24.714 --> 00:17:27.124
They didn't quite get it
done in time, did they?

00:17:27.124 --> 00:17:28.854
Meaning they finished it too late.

00:17:28.854 --> 00:17:30.924
We destroyed all of them already.

00:17:30.924 --> 00:17:33.444
All the other robots have been destroyed, too.

00:17:33.824 --> 00:17:36.364
Oh well, case closed, then.

00:17:36.364 --> 00:17:38.264
You girls can relax now.

00:17:38.264 --> 00:17:39.734
Okay!

00:17:41.964 --> 00:17:44.134
So why do I have this nasty feeling?

00:17:44.134 --> 00:17:46.504
Like we've overlooked something.

00:17:47.344 --> 00:17:50.814
Normal Peoples' objective is
the elimination of espers.

00:17:50.814 --> 00:17:53.874
They cyber attacked BABEL HQ to that end.

00:17:54.344 --> 00:17:58.784
But it's odd that they only
used robots in their attack.

00:17:59.014 --> 00:18:00.984
Why?

00:18:00.984 --> 00:18:04.324
These robots can record data too, can't they?

00:18:05.294 --> 00:18:07.124
Um... Uh, yeah.

00:18:07.424 --> 00:18:12.164
I see. So, they can gather data on
BABEL's espers too, can't they?

00:18:13.094 --> 00:18:18.334
That's it! They want to release data to
the world to make espers look bad!

00:18:22.904 --> 00:18:25.634
That was unusually nice of you, Kyosuke.

00:18:32.054 --> 00:18:36.924
HEY! Hey! Has anyone left the building yet?!

00:18:37.294 --> 00:18:40.724
No. The bulkheads are still
down, so nobody's left.

00:18:40.724 --> 00:18:42.314
Really? Thank goodness.

00:18:44.034 --> 00:18:46.294
BABEL 1!

00:18:46.834 --> 00:18:51.504
Chief, this is reception. Have you
ordered BABEL 1 to take off?

00:18:51.504 --> 00:18:52.834
What are you talking about?

00:18:52.834 --> 00:18:54.604
Pilot of BABEL 1, please respond!

00:18:54.604 --> 00:18:55.404
The line's being intercepted!
Pilot of BABEL 1, please respond!

00:18:55.404 --> 00:18:55.974
The line's being intercepted!

00:18:55.974 --> 00:18:58.344
I don't have control!
Don't open the hatch!

00:18:58.744 --> 00:19:01.284
Natsuko's scanning the complex,

00:19:01.284 --> 00:19:03.754
and she says BABEL 1's preparing to take off!

00:19:03.754 --> 00:19:05.044
It's launching!

00:19:12.494 --> 00:19:14.724
The robots running wild was a diversion!

00:19:14.724 --> 00:19:18.894
Their real objective was to get the
data of the girls in the simulation

00:19:18.894 --> 00:19:22.164
so they could release it publicly
as anti-esper propaganda!

00:19:24.434 --> 00:19:25.704
Stop BABEL 1!

00:19:25.704 --> 00:19:26.434
Roger!

00:19:27.104 --> 00:19:29.834
Special espers, The Children...

00:19:33.884 --> 00:19:35.404
Released!

00:19:35.544 --> 00:19:36.944
<<RELEASED>>

00:19:41.084 --> 00:19:42.784
All right!

00:19:42.784 --> 00:19:45.344
Let's kick that jerk's butt!

00:19:46.594 --> 00:19:48.364
Hurry, Aoi!

00:19:48.364 --> 00:19:49.794
I know.

00:19:58.474 --> 00:19:59.964
Oh, yeah!

00:20:00.704 --> 00:20:03.804
PSYCHIC SHOULDER THROW!

00:20:14.324 --> 00:20:16.844
Freeze! We're taking that data back.

00:20:17.394 --> 00:20:19.694
You espers are all freaks!

00:20:19.694 --> 00:20:21.884
We need to free human society of them!

00:20:28.404 --> 00:20:30.424
You're wrong!

00:20:30.674 --> 00:20:33.134
You're wrong! Espers are human beings!

00:20:33.134 --> 00:20:36.404
Even those girls are human beings with a future!

00:20:36.804 --> 00:20:39.834
They need space to stretch their wings!

00:20:41.314 --> 00:20:42.334
Minamoto...

00:20:43.814 --> 00:20:45.514
Don't make me laugh! Espers are-

00:20:47.254 --> 00:20:48.484
Are you still talking, you bigot?!

00:20:48.484 --> 00:20:49.784
Chief...
Are you still talking, you bigot?!

00:20:50.624 --> 00:20:52.894
Arrest the suspect and get him out of here!

00:20:52.894 --> 00:20:54.254
Yes, Chief!

00:20:57.034 --> 00:20:58.964
Minamoto.

00:20:58.964 --> 00:21:05.994
Minamoto, I think you know what that
guy just said isn't that radical.

00:21:06.734 --> 00:21:08.804
It isn't just radicals.

00:21:08.804 --> 00:21:13.434
There are lots of regular people
who feel exactly the same.

00:21:13.984 --> 00:21:16.954
Despite that, you still want to
send those girls to school?

00:21:16.954 --> 00:21:18.954
Well...

00:21:18.954 --> 00:21:21.284
Well, it's our duty. We can't say no.

00:21:21.284 --> 00:21:22.354
Exactly!

00:21:22.354 --> 00:21:24.794
It's our duty to hang out with normal people.

00:21:24.794 --> 00:21:26.814
And we're a little interested, too.

00:21:28.664 --> 00:21:29.864
Girls...

00:21:29.864 --> 00:21:33.604
We can make a lot of friends and
try that 103-legged race!

00:21:33.604 --> 00:21:36.104
No, no, you have too many legs, then.

00:21:36.104 --> 00:21:38.374
You'd have some weird friends there.

00:21:38.374 --> 00:21:40.474
I think Kaoru could manage it.

00:21:40.474 --> 00:21:41.774
Sakaki.

00:21:41.774 --> 00:21:45.214
Well, so what's an extra leg or two?

00:21:45.214 --> 00:21:49.984
If they go to school and make lots of friends,

00:21:49.984 --> 00:21:52.714
don't you think one day the world
will change its point of view?

00:22:00.294 --> 00:22:02.024
I suppose so.

00:22:02.264 --> 00:22:04.824
I can't wait to go to school!

00:22:05.334 --> 00:22:07.594
Let's finish getting our book bags ready.

00:22:19.444 --> 00:22:24.574
There's no point in hiding it

00:22:24.884 --> 00:22:28.944
I know everything

00:22:29.684 --> 00:22:35.124
It's no mystery, because

00:22:35.494 --> 00:22:40.894
I love you

00:22:41.134 --> 00:22:45.534
Go on, look at me

00:22:45.804 --> 00:22:50.104
Truly, the bond of love we share

00:22:50.104 --> 00:22:52.074
Is absolute!

00:22:52.314 --> 00:22:57.014
An eternal, unchanging

00:22:57.014 --> 00:23:03.654
Absolute declaration to the world
I'll shout from Everest!

00:23:03.654 --> 00:23:08.494
I've accepted it

00:23:08.494 --> 00:23:12.894
The bond of love we share

00:23:12.894 --> 00:23:15.104
Is absolute!

00:23:15.104 --> 00:23:19.534
My wish, when fortune smiles on me

00:23:19.834 --> 00:23:23.944
In San Pietro, I'll swear it to you

00:23:23.944 --> 00:23:26.744
An absolute declaration of love!

00:23:39.924 --> 00:23:41.064
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:41.064 --> 00:23:42.894
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:43.424 --> 00:23:44.434
I'm Kaoru Akashi!

00:23:44.434 --> 00:23:45.494
I'm Aoi Nogami!

00:23:45.494 --> 00:23:46.794
I'm Shiho Sannomiya!

00:23:46.794 --> 00:23:49.434
Due to circumstances at home,
we've transferred into this class!

00:23:49.434 --> 00:23:52.994
Those are ESP limiters, right?
You three are espers, aren't you?

00:23:53.974 --> 00:23:55.344
So am I!

00:23:55.344 --> 00:23:57.034
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:57.114 --> 00:24:00.544
Episode 6: "Ready to Rumble!
In Front of Our Classmates!?"

00:24:00.544 --> 00:24:03.044
We have four espers as classmates?

00:24:03.044 --> 00:24:04.654
I don't like it.

00:24:04.654 --> 00:24:04.954
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:04.954 --> 00:24:07.324
Ready to Rumble!
In Front of Our Classmates!?
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:07.324 --> 00:24:09.914
Ready to Rumble!
In Front of Our Classmates!?
